  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0\n      - Add ambient multi-document transactions via WithTransaction / WithTransactionAsync (writes and reads join the session automatically).\n      - Add EnsureIndexes / EnsureIndexesAsync to create and verify attribute indexes at startup; missing indexes throw IndexVerificationException.\n      - Add TTL indexes with SingleFieldIndex.ExpireAfter (durations such as \"30d\", \"12h\", or ISO-8601).\n      - Add Unique on CompoundIndex for uniqueness across grouped fields.\n      - Add opt-in soft delete ([Collection(SoftDelete = true)]): queries/counts/updates skip deleted documents by default; Restore* and HardRemove* for restore and permanent delete.\n      - Add fluent atomic partial updates (Set, Unset, Push, Pull, AddToSet, Inc) with Update / UpdateOne / UpdateMany.\n      - Replace mongo-url-parser with ciu-parser for connection-string parsing; bump MongoDB.Driver to 3.12.0.",
